Changelog: 15-11-2026 08:59:47

Breaking. SFTP Tools for Windows has its own repository: it was the Windows executable of BC-250 SFTP Tools,
built in the BC250 Bazzite Suite. It is called SFTP Tools now: SFTP-Tools.exe in sftp-tools-<version>-windows.zip,
released here with tags v<x.y.z>. Its settings, profiles and log move once, at the first start, from the
bc250-sftp-tools folders to sftp-tools. The code is the suite's SFTP Tools 2.2.0 with the part of the suite's shared
code it uses (sftp_tools/core), so it needs nothing from the suite.

